  "summary": "6 features across HagiCode-org/hagicode-core, HagiCode-org/web.",
  "bodyHtml": "<h2 id=\"features\">Features</h2>\n<h3 id=\"hagicode-orghagicode-core\">HagiCode-org/hagicode-core</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>session:</strong> add Session System Message Compiler (<a href=\"https://github.com/HagiCode-org/hagicode-core/commit/2f81bd099526fd2a435feee405dead8c72ee9375\"><code>2f81bd0</code></a>)</li>\n<li><strong>wizard:</strong> add Wizard Component Detection feature (<a href=\"https://github.com/HagiCode-org/hagicode-core/commit/38ca5b11f731bbd427e8c8ecdc540cb14b38083f\"><code>38ca5b1</code></a>)</li>\n<li><strong>hero:</strong> add Hero Soul and Traits feature (<a href=\"https://github.com/HagiCode-org/hagicode-core/commit/759fe5b62ea65730aa5a8ef5da6adca6f4f2f3fb\"><code>759fe5b</code></a>)</li>\n<li><strong>soul-marketplace:</strong> add Soul Marketplace feature (<a href=\"https://github.com/HagiCode-org/hagicode-core/commit/96eb3451c28ced218d9f25a529ca259e1228c9f8\"><code>96eb345</code></a>)</li>\n<li><strong>httpapi:</strong> extract shared HTTP controller assembly from PCode.Web (<a href=\"https://github.com/HagiCode-org/hagicode-core/commit/6a4b024f6d880ba3960b219d349a10ebecaeb6e6\"><code>6a4b024</code></a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"hagicode-orgweb\">HagiCode-org/web</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>add soul marketplace, wizard detection, and proposal stage improvements (<a href=\"https://github.com/HagiCode-org/web/commit/2957ea89b678171fa2757854548520375d56e3a9\"><code>2957ea8</code></a>)</li>\n</ul>",
